# Files excluded from the published archive.
#
# `.pubignore` takes precedence over `.gitignore` when pub collects the files
# for `pub publish`, so the rules of `.gitignore` are repeated here and the
# gallery is added to them. Keeping the two in step matters: a rule that lived
# only in `.gitignore` would silently stop applying to the archive.
#
# The gallery under `showcase/` is the visual documentation of this package. It
# is a Flutter web application carrying one golden baseline per page and per
# theme, which is most of a 3 MB archive that a consumer of the library has no
# use for. It stays in the repository and is published to GitHub Pages instead;
# see `showcase/README.md`.

# Dart / Flutter
.dart_tool/
.packages
build/

# A library does not fix versions for its consumers: the lockfile is not
# published.
pubspec.lock

# Coverage
coverage/

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/

# Operating system
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Failure artefacts written when a golden test fails.
test/golden/failures/

# Editor workspaces are local: they point at paths that only exist on one
# machine.
*.code-workspace

# Local dependency overrides, used to point the gallery at a checkout of this
# package that sits beside it.
pubspec_overrides.yaml

# The gallery itself.
showcase/
